Hi, I used the GP-02Kit to add GPS to the GD77. <br>I connected the power control to the N/F pin of GP-02Kit. <br>To reduce the consumption, I connected the EN pin of the LP3992 to the N/F pin through a 560 ohm resistor. The total consuption is thus less than 0.6mA (through the MCU "shorted" 10k pull-up).<dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=3025&amp;sid=40da7465e96b3506c116b62debdd40b8" class="postimage" alt="Snímka obrazovky 2025-06-25 134704.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2649">om1aeg</a> — Wed Jun 25, 2025 11:57 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
