Yes, the almanac last for longer so a longer battery life is still worth having. However it  only helps with finding the satellites from cold. Modern multi channel receiver's are good at doing that even without the almanac.<br><br>The ephemeris data is needed for the actual position fix and that only lasts for up to 4 hours.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sun Jun 01, 2025 3:57 pm</p><hr />
